# receiver, by the names asked or by an earlier rule, and still the read and the call went by name: outside loops that rule was silent, and a guess at the read of a method has to buy more than the read itself:
# one operation was enough only for what is declared: a map, a set, a list out of a variable of the file that stays.
# The call is the loop: where it is handed a closure made for it and a list is only expected, the read of the method opens the guess. It is a guess: the receiver is tested; whatever else arrives runs as written.
# Nothing is copied to the site that was not copied there behind a list that is known.
